      'ha': <String, String>{
        'Yusuf Muhammad Oyigye, also known as Digitaldoc, is a Nigerian student of the Faculty of Medicine and Surgery with a strong interest in tech and a passion for learning new things.': 'Yusuf Muhammad Oyigye, wanda aka fi sani da Digitaldoc, ɗalibi ne ɗan Najeriya a Tsangayar Likitanci da Tiyata, mai sha\'awar fasaha sosai kuma mai son koyon sababbin abubuwa.',
        'The idea behind Nubify came from different life experiences, personal observations and challenges encountered around campus. As a student, I started imagining how university life could become more connected, engaging and convenient if there was a platform where students could interact beyond the classroom, share experiences, exchange ideas and build meaningful connections.': 'Tunanin Nubify ya samo asali ne daga abubuwan rayuwa daban-daban, lura na kaina da kuma ƙalubalen da na fuskanta a harabar jami\'a. A matsayina na ɗalibi, na fara tunanin yadda rayuwar jami\'a za ta ƙara haɗuwa, ta ƙara armashi kuma ta ƙara sauƙi idan akwai wani dandali inda ɗalibai za su iya mu\'amala fiye da cikin aji, su raba abubuwan da suka gani, su yi musayar ra\'ayoyi kuma su ƙulla zumunci mai ma\'ana.',
        'My vision was never simply to build another application or social media platform. I wanted to create something meaningful, something that could bring students together and strengthen the bond within our university.': 'Burina bai taɓa zama kawai gina wata manhaja ko dandalin sada zumunta ba. Na so in ƙirƙiri wani abu mai ma\'ana, wani abu da zai haɗa kan ɗalibai kuma ya ƙarfafa dangantaka a cikin jami\'armu.',
        'My goal is to unite and connect NUB students digitally, regardless of their faculty, nationality, race, religion or cultural background. I believe that despite our differences, we all share something in common: we are part of the same university community.': 'Burina shi ne in haɗa kan ɗaliban NUB ta hanyar fasahar zamani, ko da kuwa menene tsangayarsu, ƙasarsu, kabilarsu, addininsu ko al\'adarsu. Na yi imani cewa duk da bambance-bambancenmu, akwai abin da muka yi tarayya a kai: dukkanmu ɓangare ne na al\'ummar jami\'a ɗaya.',
        'Building Nubify while pursuing Medicine and Surgery has not always been easy. Balancing academics with learning and working on tech comes with its own challenges. There have been moments of uncertainty, mistakes and plenty of things to figure out along the way. But through consistency, determination and a willingness to keep learning, I have continued moving forward.': 'Gina Nubify a lokacin da nake karatun Likitanci da Tiyata ba koyaushe ya kasance da sauƙi ba. Daidaita karatu da koyon fasaha da aiki a kanta yana da nasa ƙalubalen. An samu lokutan shakku, kurakurai da abubuwa da yawa da sai na gano su a hanya. Amma ta hanyar juriya, ƙuduri da niyyar ci gaba da koyo, na ci gaba da tafiya gaba.',
        'I don\'t claim to know everything, and I\'m still learning every day. But one thing I have come to believe is that you don\'t have to know everything before you start working towards something you\'ve always imagined.': 'Ban ce na san komai ba, kuma har yanzu ina koyo kowace rana. Amma abu ɗaya da na zo na yarda da shi shi ne, ba sai ka san komai ba kafin ka fara aiki zuwa ga abin da ka daɗe kana tunani a kai.',
        'What started as a delusion, imagination, an idea that sometimes seemed like a distant dream, has gradually become a reality.': 'Abin da ya fara a matsayin ruɗi, tunani, wani ra\'ayi da wani lokaci yake kama da mafarki mai nisa, sannu a hankali ya zama gaskiya.',
        'Nubify is more than just an application to me. It represents an idea, a passion, a personal journey and my little contribution to the community I belong to.': 'A wurina, Nubify ya wuce manhaja kawai. Yana wakiltar wani tunani, wata sha\'awa, tafiyata ta kaina da kuma ɗan gudummawata ga al\'ummar da nake cikinta.',
        'I know there is still a long way to go, and Nubify has plenty of room to grow and improve.': 'Na san cewa har yanzu akwai sauran tafiya mai nisa, kuma Nubify yana da sarari mai yawa don girma da ingantuwa.',
        'Founder / Developer / Super-Admin of Nubify': 'Wanda ya kafa / Mai haɓakawa / Babban Mai Gudanar da Nubify',
        'One university. Different backgrounds. One connected community.': 'Jami\'a ɗaya. Asali daban-daban. Al\'umma ɗaya da ke haɗe.',
