      'yo': <String, String>{
        'Yusuf Muhammad Oyigye, also known as Digitaldoc, is a Nigerian student of the Faculty of Medicine and Surgery with a strong interest in tech and a passion for learning new things.': 'Yusuf Muhammad Oyigye, tí a tún mọ̀ sí Digitaldoc, jẹ́ akẹ́kọ̀ọ́ ọmọ Nàìjíríà ní Ẹ̀ka Ìṣègùn àti Iṣẹ́ Abẹ, tí ó nífẹ̀ẹ́ sí ìmọ̀ ẹ̀rọ gidigidi, tí ó sì ní ìtara láti máa kọ́ àwọn nǹkan tuntun.',
        'The idea behind Nubify came from different life experiences, personal observations and challenges encountered around campus. As a student, I started imagining how university life could become more connected, engaging and convenient if there was a platform where students could interact beyond the classroom, share experiences, exchange ideas and build meaningful connections.': 'Èrò Nubify wá láti inú oríṣiríṣi ìrírí ayé, àkíyèsí ara ẹni àti àwọn ìpèníjà tí mo bá pàdé ní ọgbà ilé-ẹ̀kọ́. Gẹ́gẹ́ bí akẹ́kọ̀ọ́, mo bẹ̀rẹ̀ sí í ronú bí ìgbésí ayé ní yunifásítì ṣe lè túbọ̀ ní ìsopọ̀, kí ó gbádùn mọ́ni, kí ó sì rọrùn bí pẹpẹ kan bá wà níbi tí àwọn akẹ́kọ̀ọ́ ti lè bá ara wọn ṣe pọ̀ ju inú kíláàsì lọ, pín ìrírí, pàṣípààrọ̀ èrò, kí wọ́n sì kọ́ àjọṣepọ̀ tó nítumọ̀.',
        'My vision was never simply to build another application or social media platform. I wanted to create something meaningful, something that could bring students together and strengthen the bond within our university.': 'Ìran mi kò fi ìgbà kan jẹ́ láti kàn kọ́ ohun èlò mìíràn tàbí pẹpẹ ìkànnì àjọlò mìíràn. Mo fẹ́ ṣẹ̀dá nǹkan tó nítumọ̀, nǹkan tí ó lè kó àwọn akẹ́kọ̀ọ́ jọ, kí ó sì mú ìdè láàárín yunifásítì wa lágbára sí i.',
        'My goal is to unite and connect NUB students digitally, regardless of their faculty, nationality, race, religion or cultural background. I believe that despite our differences, we all share something in common: we are part of the same university community.': 'Àfojúsùn mi ni láti ṣọ̀kan àti so àwọn akẹ́kọ̀ọ́ NUB pọ̀ lórí ẹ̀rọ ayélujára, láìka ẹ̀ka ẹ̀kọ́, orílẹ̀-èdè, ẹ̀yà, ẹ̀sìn tàbí àṣà wọn sí. Mo gbàgbọ́ pé láìka ìyàtọ̀ wa sí, ohun kan wà tí gbogbo wa jọ ní: apá kan náà ni gbogbo wa jẹ́ nínú àwùjọ yunifásítì kan náà.',
        'Building Nubify while pursuing Medicine and Surgery has not always been easy. Balancing academics with learning and working on tech comes with its own challenges. There have been moments of uncertainty, mistakes and plenty of things to figure out along the way. But through consistency, determination and a willingness to keep learning, I have continued moving forward.': 'Kíkọ́ Nubify nígbà tí mo ń kẹ́kọ̀ọ́ Ìṣègùn àti Iṣẹ́ Abẹ kò fi ìgbà gbogbo rọrùn. Ṣíṣe ìwọ̀ntúnwọ̀nsì láàárín ẹ̀kọ́ àti kíkọ́ nípa ìmọ̀ ẹ̀rọ àti ṣíṣiṣẹ́ lé e lórí ní àwọn ìpèníjà tirẹ̀. Àwọn àsìkò iyèméjì wà, àṣìṣe wà, àwọn nǹkan púpọ̀ sì wà tí mo ní láti mọ̀ lójú ọ̀nà. Ṣùgbọ́n nípasẹ̀ ìdúróṣinṣin, ìpinnu àti ìfẹ́ láti máa kọ́ ẹ̀kọ́ nìṣó, mo ti ń tẹ̀síwájú.',
        'I don\'t claim to know everything, and I\'m still learning every day. But one thing I have come to believe is that you don\'t have to know everything before you start working towards something you\'ve always imagined.': 'Mi ò sọ pé mo mọ ohun gbogbo, mo ṣì ń kẹ́kọ̀ọ́ lójoojúmọ́. Ṣùgbọ́n ohun kan tí mo ti wá gbàgbọ́ ni pé kò pọndandan kí o mọ ohun gbogbo kí o tó bẹ̀rẹ̀ sí í ṣiṣẹ́ sí ohun tí o ti ń fojú inú wò tipẹ́.',
        'What started as a delusion, imagination, an idea that sometimes seemed like a distant dream, has gradually become a reality.': 'Ohun tí ó bẹ̀rẹ̀ bí ìtànjẹ, ìrònú, èrò kan tí ó máa ń dàbí àlá tó jìnnà nígbà mìíràn, ti di òtítọ́ díẹ̀díẹ̀.',
        'Nubify is more than just an application to me. It represents an idea, a passion, a personal journey and my little contribution to the community I belong to.': 'Nubify ju ohun èlò lásán lọ fún mi. Ó dúró fún èrò kan, ìtara kan, ìrìn-àjò ara ẹni àti ìdáwọ́lé kékeré mi sí àwùjọ tí mo jẹ́ ara rẹ̀.',
        'I know there is still a long way to go, and Nubify has plenty of room to grow and improve.': 'Mo mọ̀ pé ọ̀nà ṣì jìn, Nubify sì ní àyè púpọ̀ láti dàgbà àti láti túbọ̀ dára sí i.',
        'Founder / Developer / Super-Admin of Nubify': 'Olùdásílẹ̀ / Olùgbéṣẹ́ / Alákòóso Àgbà Nubify',
